              "J4 Dept. of Alchemy",
              "J3 Lab",
              "J7 Fruits and Nuts"
            ],
            "interpretation": "Right wing is the longer Chemistry/Alchemy/Lab side in column J, extending farther south from the H6 dome core.",
            "modelScaleNote": "Wing model length is intentionally architectural rather than tile-count literal: each wing runs 18.6m north-south, matching the central core width so the Central Complex reads as a square campus block."
          },
          "attachmentContract": {
            "shoulderSource": "wireframe3d-central-dome-core.commands.json",
