              "westEdge": 9.3,
              "frontZ": 5.9,
              "rearZ": -12.7
            }
          },
          "designIntent": "Separate right wing for the Central Complex. The wing is intentionally lengthened to match the 18.6m central core width, so the east-side Chemistry/Alchemy/Lab range reads as one long side of the square Central Complex rather than a small appendage beside the shoulder.",
          "photoInterpretation": {
            "courtyardPhoto": "Snowy plaza view of the right wing: longer and more repetitive than the left wing, with many inward-facing bay divisions and a heavier terminal pavilion at the far end.",
            "modelResponse": "Lengthens the inward courtyard-facing facade to central-core width, with denser repeated bays and a stronger terminal pavilion than the left wing."
          }
